stderr | ... > renders the image with an alt, the name uppercase, the price, and one combined colour+size node
Could not parse CSS stylesheet
stderr | ... > hideStepperAndActions suppresses the stepper and every actions surface, and nothing throws
Could not parse CSS stylesheet
